supabase/.temp/

# --- Cloudflare Workers local state ---
.wrangler/

# Fantasy Points RAW API dumps (NFL research). 8.6 GB / 4,519 files, and 12 of them exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit (receiving-separation-by-routes_2025.json is 227 MB),
# so any branch carrying them CANNOT be pushed — which is how research/nba-2026-09-21
# stranded 140 commits with no remote copy. They are fully regenerable with fp_pull.py and
# the loaded form already lives in the fp_data Supabase tables + the fpdata parquets, so
# nothing is lost by keeping them off git. Track the PARQUETS, never raw/.
research/nfl-extreme-outcomes/data/fpdata/raw/
